  "term": "reading readiness",
  "definition": "Reading readiness is the set of early abilities linked to learning to read. It includes pre-reading skills such as phonological and alphabetic awareness, naming speed, language and metalinguistic abilities, and basic cognitive processes that can affect early reading development.",
